AArch64 LB+casa-fail-po+poap
"LB: failing CASA reads x (comparand 2) then STR y; P1 LDAR y then STR x. A failing CASA still acquires"
{
0:X1=x; 0:X3=y;
1:X1=x; 1:X3=y;
}
 P0              | P1           ;
 MOV W0,#2       | LDAR W0,[X3] ;
 MOV W2,#3       | MOV W4,#1    ;
 CASA W0,W2,[X1] | STR W4,[X1]  ;
 MOV W4,#1       |              ;
 STR W4,[X3]     |              ;
exists (0:X0=1 /\ 1:X0=1)
